### Test Server Connection
GET http://localhost:5000/

###

### Register User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Azri",
    "email": "azri@example.com",
    "password": "pass123"
}

###

### Login User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "azri@example.com",
    "password": "pass123"
}


###

### Create Diary Entry (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/diaries
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "title": "Testing API with HTTP Client: Part 1",
    "content": "Testing the API endpoints using the REST Client extension is very confusing.",
    "mood": "Frustrated"
}

###

### Get All Diary Entries (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diaries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get Diary Entry by ID (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diaries/YOUR_DIARY_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Update Diary Entry (Protected)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/diaries/YOUR_DIARY_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "title": "Introduction to Feathers.js and MongoDB.",
    "content": "I am learning a middleware framework and database integration.",
    "mood": "Curious"
}

###

### Delete Diary Entry (Protected)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/diaries/YOUR_DIARY_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

